BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896
 .nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Microsoft-Class.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/u
 ploads/2024/02/Microsoft-Class.jpg
UID:0Lc87jOa_QcaHvnlbQ7OM
SUMMARY:Microsoft Office Class - Afternoon
DTSTAMP:20260803T120314Z
DTSTART:20260826T130000Z
DESCRIPTION:This class is designed to increase a beginner’s confidence in t
	he use of Microsoft Office Suite including\, word\, excel\, outlook\, othe
	r Microsoft Office apps and programs\, while using JAWS screen reader. You
	 will learn key functions of each program\, JAWS shortcut commands\, and o
	ther tools and tips that will enhance your Microsoft Office Suite knowledg
	e to help ensure your computer interaction is less stress and ready for su
	ccess! \nPlease note\, a basic level of knowledge of JAWS is required to t
	ake this class. We offer training classes on JAWS\; please contact us for 
	more information. \nRegister Online\n\n                \n                 
	       \n                            Microsoft Office Class Registration\n
								"*" indicates required fields \n                        					\n				
			Δ\n						\n						\n\n					\n                        NameThis field is fo
